ACE-Step UI (Pinokio launcher) — notice
======================================

This repository is a mirror of the Pinokio launcher maintained by cocktailpeanut:

    https://github.com/cocktailpeanut/ace-step-ui.pinokio

The launcher files (`install.js`, `start.js`, `update.js`, `reset.js`,
`pinokio.js`, `pinokio.json`, `icon.jpeg`) originate from that project.

Upstream licensing
------------------
The upstream launcher ships **no `LICENSE` file**, so its code has not been
published under an open-source license. This notice grants no license over
the upstream files, and this repository makes no licensing claim about them.
Redistributing them may require the upstream author's permission.

The projects this launcher installs carry their own terms:

  - ACE-Step 1.5 (`ace-step/ACE-Step-1.5`) — MIT
  - ACE-Step UI (`fspecii/ace-step-ui`) — the repository ships no `LICENSE`
    file; its README states MIT

Changes made in this fork
-------------------------
The changes in this fork are local fixes to the launcher, listed in the
README under "What changed in this fork". They are contributed back to the
upstream project in the hope of being merged there; until then, this fork
carries them.

Adding a `LICENSE` file to this repository is deliberately **not** done
here: choosing a license for code whose upstream terms are undefined is a
decision for the repository owner, not a mechanical fix.
